pieboot (0.1.1) blueberry-pie-os; urgency=medium

  * pieboot.fallback=1 in the boot-args sets the firmware's tryboot flag and
    arms the watchdog, so that a hang, a panic or any reset can boot
    tryboot.txt.
  * The firmware mailbox gives up after a second without an answer.

